                "subject": "Thank you for your Sadaqah: receipt {{2.receipt}}",
                "content": "<div style=\"background:#faf7f0;padding:24px 0;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td align=\"center\"><table width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e3dccb;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden\"><tr><td style=\"background:#0f4c5c;padding:20px 28px;text-align:left\"><div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#ffffff\">CRESCENT HOPE FOUNDATION</div><div style=\"width:48px;height:2px;background:#b8862e;margin:8px 0\"></div><div style=\"font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#e9dfc6\">Giving with care, reporting with honesty</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:28px\"><h1 style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:23px;color:#0f4c5c\">Thank you for your Sadaqah</h1><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;color:#1d2a2c;line-height:1.6\">As-salamu alaykum {{2.firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;color:#1d2a2c;line-height:1.6\">Thank you for your Sadaqah. We have received it safely.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;color:#1d2a2c;line-height:1.6\">May Allah accept it from you and reward you.</p><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:18px 0;border:1px solid #e3dccb;border-radius:6px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:13px;color:#5f6b6a;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;width:38%\">Receipt number</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:14px;color:#1d2a2c;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;font-weight:600\">{{2.receipt}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:13px;color:#5f6b6a;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;width:38%\">Date received</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:14px;color:#1d2a2c;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;font-weight:600\">{{formatDate(1.`0`; \"D MMMM YYYY\")}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:13px;color:#5f6b6a;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;width:38%\">Amount</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:14px;color:#1d2a2c;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;font-weight:600\">{{2.currency}} {{formatNumber(2.amount; 2; \".\"; \",\")}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:13px;color:#5f6b6a;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;width:38%\">Fund</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:14px;color:#1d2a2c;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;font-weight:600\">Sadaqah</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:13px;color:#5f6b6a;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;width:38%\">Donor</td><td style=\"padding:10px 15px;font-size:14px;color:#1d2a2c;border-bottom:1px solid #e3dccb;font-weight:600\">{{1.`1`}}</td></tr></table><table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:0 0 16px;border-left:3px solid #b8862e;background:#faf7f0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:12px 16px\"><div style=\"font:700 12px Arial;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#b8862e;margin-bottom:6px\">Where your Sadaqah goes</div><div style=\"font-size:14px;color:#1d2a2c;line-height:1.6\">Your Sadaqah supports our general programmes: food parcels for families, help with school costs, and emergency support when a family is in crisis.</div></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;color:#1d2a2c;line-height:1.6\">Please keep this email for your records. If any detail is wrong, reply to this email and we will correct it.</p><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:15px;color:#1d2a2c;line-height:1.6\">With thanks,<br>The Crescent Hope Foundation team</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"background:#faf7f0;padding:16px 28px;font-size:12px;color:#5f6b6a;border-top:1px solid #e3dccb;line-height:1.6\">This email is an acknowledgement of your gift. It is not a tax receipt.<br>Crescent Hope Foundation (a fictional organisation) &middot; hello@example.org</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></div>",
                "bodyType": "rawHtml"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "x": 900,
                  "y": 0
                }
              },
              "onerror": [
                {
                  "id": 300,
                  "module": "http:MakeRequest",
                  "version": 4,
                  "parameters": {
                    "tlsType": "",
                    "authenticationType": "noAuth"
                  },
                  "mapper": {
                    "url": "https://hook.eu1.make.com/YOUR_ERROR_WATCHER_WEBHOOK",
                    "method": "post",
